      "id": 1,
      "primary_message": "Season patties generously with salt and pepper. In a large cast iron or stainless-steel skillet, heat oil over medium-high heat until shimmering. Add patties and cook, flipping every minute or two, until an instant-read thermometer registers 50°C for medium-rare or 57°C for medium. Transfer to a plate and allow to rest for 5 minutes.",
